    <string name="about_privacy_head">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">This app collects nothing and sends nothing anywhere. It asks for no permissions and has no internet permission. It keeps your games under way, the two settings and your counts of games played and won in its own private storage on the phone; uninstalling it removes them. There are no ads, no analytics and no tracking, and the app is not included in phone backups.</string>
